5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m so excited to pick our next seed! I really want to know who we can actually hire right now. Who else cares about talent?,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,George,,I care about the reality behind our past wins. Which companies actually kept their customers?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I’m curious about the cash flow. Who else wants to see how much we can actually borrow against our current holdings?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I want to see how our quarter-end reporting works! If we add a new company, will it make closing books harder?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I’m focused on why past deals stalled. I want to know what external obstacles actually blocked our previous investments from launching.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@George, that’s smart! I’m picking “Retained recruiters’ placement times” and “Adviser bench and partner board seats” to see who’s actually available.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,George,,I’ll check “Account retention through price rises” and “Delivery records of two holdings.” I need to see if our past successes were real or just luck.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,I’m picking “Reserve accounts and follow-on calls” and “Terms of last winter's credit line.” I need to know exactly what’s left in the tank before we write this check.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I’ll check “Independent checks on holdings' reported figures” and “Appraisal needs at the last audit.” I need to know if our numbers are real before adding more!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I’ll check “Security review time before first deployment” and “Profile of the exits and the write-off.” I need to see if external delays are structural or just bad luck.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@May, borrowing against holdings sounds risky! I hope we don’t run out of cash before we even start.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,George,,"@May, I hear your caution. But I worry we’re borrowing against a foundation that might be crumbling. Let’s verify the ground first.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"@George, I’m not ignoring the risk, I’m managing it. If the ground crumbles, I need to know exactly how much air we have left to breathe.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@May, exactly! If the ground is shaky, I need to know if our numbers are real. I’m checking the audit needs to see if we can trust the books!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, I agree. Knowing our buffer is vital. But I’m focused on the external friction that delayed past deals. I need to see if that’s a structural problem we’re repeating.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,"@Mizuki, structural delays are scary! I hope our new hire isn’t stuck in security limbo. Let’s see what you find!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,George,,"@Mizuki, I hope those delays are just noise. I’m watching the retention data closely to see if our past stories hold up under scrutiny.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,"@Mio, I’ll find out if we can actually borrow against these assets. If the numbers are shaky, I need to know our exact runway before we commit.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,"@Mio, I hope the new company doesn’t break our reporting! I’m checking the audit needs to see if we can trust the books!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Mio, I’ll confirm if security reviews are the bottleneck. If they are, we need a candidate with a clear path to deployment, not just a good pitch.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
