35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Wow, recruiters take four months for field crews! But three logistics advisers are sitting idle. That’s a huge mismatch!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,George,,The shopkeeper tool lost a third of its accounts after raising prices. That’s a red flag. I need to know if our other holdings are holding steady.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"@Mio, four months is brutal. But my credit line ignores unbilled invoices. We’re borrowing against dead weight, not real cash.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@George, that’s scary! My audit check showed hardware needs outside appraisals, adding six weeks! If we pick a tech company, we avoid that nightmare!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, that hardware appraisal delay is exactly the external friction I feared. My data shows security reviews take three quarters for regulated clients. We must avoid that bottleneck.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Mizuki, three quarters is forever! But those idle logistics advisers are perfect for field roles. We just need a company that doesn’t need software partners!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,George,,The bank tool never missed a release. That consistency matters. I’m glad we’re not chasing the hardware delays again.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@George, consistency is nice, but my reserves are bleeding twice as fast as planned. We need a company that doesn’t force us to call follow-on money early.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@May, that’s terrifying! If reserves bleed fast, I can’t trust the numbers. I need to know if our software holdings are hiding bad data!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, that bleeding is critical. My exit data shows back-office tooling sells well, but physical operations fail. We need a software play to avoid that structural risk.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Mizuki, software is safer! But I’m worried about those eleven board seats. Are we over-extended? I need to know if we have bandwidth for new hires!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,George,,"@Mio, bandwidth is secondary to substance. If the product doesn’t retain users, more board seats won’t save it. I’m watching the data closely.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"@Mio, bandwidth is a luxury we can’t afford. My credit line is tight, so I need a candidate that doesn’t demand immediate, heavy capital injections.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Mio, board seats are fine if the numbers are real! My checks show software reports are self-reported, so I can’t verify them. That’s my biggest worry!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, self-reported data is a risk, but my exit profile proves software tooling is the only viable path. We must prioritize structural safety over verification anxiety.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Rin, I hear you! But those idle logistics advisers are a goldmine. We need a company where we can actually place people fast, not just verify numbers!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,George,,"@Mio, placement speed is nice, but retention is truth. If customers leave, no recruiter saves us. I need substance, not just activity.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,"@Mio, I can’t afford idle assets. I need a candidate that generates cash immediately, not one that drains my reserves while you hunt for hires.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Mio, I can’t place people if the books are a mess! I need clean, verifiable numbers before we add another company.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Mio, placement speed is irrelevant if the product stalls in security review. We need a software tool with a clear, fast deployment path to avoid that three-quarter trap.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
